sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Client app
    participant A as Authorization server
    participant R as Resource API
    Note over C: Generate code_verifier,<br/>code_challenge = S256(verifier)
    C->>A: GET /authorize?response_type=code&code_challenge&state
    A->>U: Login and consent
    U->>A: Approve
    A-->>C: Redirect with code and state
    Note over C: Check state matches
    C->>A: POST /token (code, code_verifier)
    Note over A: Verify S256(verifier) == challenge
    A-->>C: access_token, id_token, refresh_token
    C->>R: GET /api (Bearer access_token)
    R-->>C: Protected data
